---
import PresentationLayout from "@components/PresentationLayout.astro";
---

<PresentationLayout title="长者资产" eyebrow="共识类资产" narrow>
  <div class="root">

    {/* 顶部核心定义 */}
    <div class="topRow">
      <div class="defCard">
        <div class="defTitle">价值 = 共识</div>
        <div class="defBody">
          本身<strong>不产生现金流</strong>，价值完全取决于市场共识。<br/>
          共识扩大 → 有后继者接盘；共识破裂 → 无法脱手
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="darkPanel">
        {/* 长者资产 列 */}
        <div class="panelCol">
          <div>
            <div class="panelLabel">典型代表</div>
            <div class="panelTitleLaodeng">
              长者资产 <span class="panelTitleEn">Laodeng Assets</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="darkChipGrid">
            <span class="darkChip">玉石</span>

            <span class="darkChip">文玩字画</span>
            <span class="darkChip">名茶名酒</span>
            <span class="darkChip">邮票</span>
            <span class="darkChip">天珠佛牌</span>
            <span class="darkChip">红木家具</span>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 分隔线 */}
        <div class="panelDivider"></div>

        {/* 小登资产 列 */}
        <div class="panelCol">
          <div>
            <div class="panelLabel">年轻一代版本</div>
            <div class="panelTitleLaodeng">
              小登资产 <span class="panelTitleEn">Xiaodeng Assets</span>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="darkChipGrid">
            <span class="darkChip">限量球鞋</span>
            <span class="darkChip">谷子</span>
            <span class="darkChip">游戏卡牌</span>
            <span class="darkChip">潮玩盲盒</span>
            <span class="darkChip">手办</span>
            <span class="darkChip">绝版乐高</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* 小标题 */}
    <div class="sectionHeader">
      <span>🔍</span> 为什么这些东西能形成共识？三大特性
    </div>

    {/* 三大特性 */}
    <div class="featureGrid">
        {/* 特性1 */}
        <div class="featureCard">
          <div class="featureHeader">🛠️ 实用价值</div>
          <div class="featureBody">
            <div class="featureItem">能入口食用</div>
            <div class="featureItem">或能上手把玩</div>
            <div class="featureItem">或有观赏价值</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 特性2 */}
        <div class="featureCard">
          <div class="featureHeader">✨ 稀缺性</div>
          <div class="featureBody">
            <div class="featureItem">天然产量不足</div>
            <div class="featureItem">或人为控制产量</div>
            <div class="featureItem">或人造手段无法仿造天然品的瑕疵</div>
          </div>
        </div>

        {/* 特性3 */}
        <div class="featureCard">
          <div class="featureHeader">🏺 可长期保存</div>
          <div class="featureBody">
            <div class="featureItem">若妥善保管，能送主人走</div>
            <div class="featureItem">随时间流逝，使用价值折损轻微</div>
            <div class="featureItem">有些甚至还会增加</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

    {/* 底部结论 */}
    <div class="conclusion">
      <div class="conclusionText">
        <strong>💡 核心结论：</strong>
        这三大属性也只是让这些东西<strong>比一般消费品更保值</strong>而已——
        拉长时间线看，共识总会转移，无一例外都无法脱手。
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</PresentationLayout>

<style>
  .root {
    height: 100%;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  /* ---- Top definition row ---- */
  .topRow {
    display: flex;
    align-items: stretch;
    gap: 1.2rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Left beige definition card */
  .defCard {
    flex: 4;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
    background: #f0e6cd;
    border: 1px solid #d9c49a;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .defTitle {
    font-size: 1.8rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.3rem;
  }

  .defBody {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    color: #6b5416;
    line-height: 1.55;
  }

  /* Right dark panel */
  .darkPanel {
    flex: 6;
    display: flex;
    background: #6b4226;
    padding: 1.1rem 1.3rem;
    color: #fff;
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  /* Column inside dark panel */
  .panelCol {
    flex: 1;
    min-width: 0;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: space-between;
  }

  .panelLabel {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #e5e0d5;
    margin-bottom: 0.2rem;
  }

  .panelTitleLaodeng {
    font-size: 1.6rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }

  .panelTitleEn {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: #f5f0e8;
  }

  /* Divider between the two panel columns */
  .panelDivider {
    width: 0;
    border-left: 1px dashed #8a5a36;
    margin: 0 1rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* Tag chips on dark background (2-col grid) */
  .darkChipGrid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    margin-top: 0.8rem;
  }

  .darkChip {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
    font-size: 1.14rem;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .sectionHeader {
    font-size: 1rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: #6b4226;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  /* ---- Three feature cards ---- */
  .featureGrid {
    flex: 1;
    min-height: 0;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0.9rem;
  }

  .featureCard {
    background: #fff;
    border: 1px solid #d9c49a;
    position: relative;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }

  /* Top-left horizontal ribbon badge with the feature number.
     Left edge is straight/vertical; right edge tapers to a "<" chevron. */
  .featureHeader {
    background: #4a7c59;
    color: #fff;
    padding: 0.8rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    font-size: 1.4rem;
    font-weight: 800;
  }
  .featureBody {
    flex: 1;
    padding: 0.9rem 1rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    justify-content: flex-start;
    gap: 0.55rem;
  }

  .featureItem {
    display: flex;
    align-items: flex-start;
    gap: 0.5rem;
    font-size: 1.2rem;
    color: #463a2a;
    line-height: 1.45;
    padding-left: 0.4rem;
    word-break: break-word;
    overflow-wrap: anywhere;
  }

  .featureItem::before {
    content: "";
    flex-shrink: 0;
    width: 0.5rem;
    height: 0.5rem;
    margin-top: 0.55rem;
    background: #4a7c59;
    border-radius: 50%;
  }

  /* ---- Bottom conclusion footer ---- */
  .conclusion {
    background: #f0e6cd;
    border: 1px solid #d9c49a;
    padding: 0.7rem 1rem;
    border-left: 4px solid #6b4226;
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }

  .conclusionText {
    font-size: 0.92rem;
    color: #5c3a21;
    margin: 0;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }
</style>